sequenceDiagram
  actor M as Mesero
  participant F as Frontend
  participant O as OperationalController
  participant DB as PostgreSQL local
  participant WS as STOMP cocina
  M->>F: Selecciona mesa/productos
  F->>O: POST /api/orders + Idempotency-Key
  O->>DB: Valida mesa, menú y disponibilidad
  O->>DB: Inserta pedido + snapshots + historial + print job + Outbox
  DB-->>O: Commit local
  O->>WS: Publica pedido confirmado
  O-->>F: Pedido y total calculados por servidor
  F-->>M: Confirma comanda
